# Content data

- Lords: id, display name, rank (1–3), map marker, linear dialog lines, points.
- Rank 1 = 10 points, rank 2 = 20, rank 3 = 30. One lord per rank in v1.
- Opening and ending lines live beside lords, not in rendering code.
- Changing copy must not require changing Kaplay scene logic.
- First visit only grants points; data should make that id stable.
